{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour against the clock in space!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RollBot is a parkour and shooting game against the clock. Embrace the role of an ultra-fast combat robot in third-person perspective. Complete over 30 levels spread across three campaigns and explore the infinite creations of the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras/8a2b65b9dacdffe32582bf86750ac137.avif?t=1761055535\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras_big/8a2b65b9dacdffe32582bf86750ac137.avif?t=1761055535 width=800 height=323 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide variety of levels, both indoors and outdoors: traverse stations, leap from ship to ship, and confront the void of space! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits through demanding levels designed to test your reflexes and reactivity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to various challenges: eliminate obstacles, destroy your enemies, break the sound barrier, slide along walls, and take to the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own courses!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras/2e13e159812436bfadb52e419f00fee0.avif?t=1761055535\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras_big/2e13e159812436bfadb52e419f00fee0.avif?t=1761055535 width=800 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the level editor to craft your own challenges. Customize your levels, share them online, and take on the community's challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the best! Compete against other players, beat their times, and become the best! Challenge the world or your friends via the leaderboard. Leave your mark at the top, join the elite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras/2b73cbc9dcd55f736e8329f68f0b170f.avif?t=1761055535\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras_big/2b73cbc9dcd55f736e8329f68f0b170f.avif?t=1761055535 width=800 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push yourself!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your reflexes, precision, and speed. Overcome increasingly difficult courses. Suffer, doubt, think about giving up? No! There's only one solution: go for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras/01718f087b154a16eecf1dab0358257e.avif?t=1761055535\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/extras_big/01718f087b154a16eecf1dab0358257e.avif?t=1761055535 width=800 height=323 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656840?t=1761055535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/36ea225ec8a039c5a27404cc5a3dee4fb598c949/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761055535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/581a37147cdd5e1d3e084674a159dfb7465ed298/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761055535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656840/581a37147cdd5e1d3e084674a159dfb7465ed298/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761055535","categories":[{"description